.Dd September 29, 2026
.Dt BHOTKEYS-PASSWD 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm bhotkeys-passwd
.Nd set the bhotkeys greeter unlock password
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
sets the password that unlocks the greeter chord list
and writes
.Pa @PREFIX@/etc/bhotkeys.passwd
mode 0600.
.Pp
.Nm
must be run by the super-user.
An empty password is rejected.
An unrecognized option prints the usage and exits non-zero.
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width "@PREFIX@/etc/bhotkeys.passwd"
.It Pa @PREFIX@/etc/bhotkeys.passwd
Hash read by the greeter list.
.El
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Ex -std
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr bhotkeys 1
.Sh AUTHORS
.An Devin Teske Aq Mt dteske@FreeBSD.org
